.
.  Macro to generate geometric representation of 2x2 design
.  with sample response values
.
device 1 x11
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 200 200
.
xlimits 300 350
ylimits 20 30
major tic mark number 2
minor tic mark number 0
tic mark label format alpha
x1tic mark label content -1cr()300  +1cr()350
y1tic mark label content -1cr()20  +1cr()30
tic offset 3 3
tic offset units screen
.
label case asis
x1label X1cr()Temperature
y1label X2: Time
label size 5
tic label size 5
.
read x y tag
300 20 1
350 20 2
350 30 3
300 30 4
310 26 5
end of data
character 2 4 8 6 x
character size 5 all
line bl bl bl bl bl
.
plot y x tag
.
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat  2x2des3.jpeg
.
quit
